name: Recorded SHA transitions and dirty scope comparisons preserve the human decision
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY OPENROUTER_API_KEY GEMINI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/source_transition.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · 1 | base-observations
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 AWS Access Key | base-policy-signal
submit: decision fp Owned public documentation example is intentional
require-live-snap: 25 Owned public documentation example is intentional | base-human-decision
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/source_transition.py @TMP_TARGET @ART advance
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · 1 | later-recorded-ledger
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Reassess this verdict | historical-decision
submit: runs diff revision-base-003 revision-later
require-live-snap: 30 SEEN AGAIN | seen-at-later-sha
expect: Absence does not establish a fix.
expect: Recorded decisions: 1 of 1
expect: Check decision sources in Review
expect-not: carry_forward=
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 7cac9e253984e19ccc6aaeee3eb157de049ba667 | first-committed-source
expect: c557cdbf94b931ecc250b33d33d793f79036a908
submit: runs diff revision-later revision-absent
require-live-snap: 30 NOT OBSERVED IN COVERED WORK | covered-absence
expect: Absence does not establish a fix.
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 dirty | same-sha-different-content
expect: clean
expect-not: content:unknown
submit: runs diff revision-base-003 revision-narrow
require-live-snap: 30 NOT REASSESSED IN RIGHT | narrower-coverage
expect: outside the recorded scan scope
resize: 160x48
live-snap: narrow-comparison-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: narrow-comparison-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: narrow-comparison-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: narrow-comparison-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: narrow-comparison-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 20 scan scope | narrow-reason-40x12
keys: Tab
live-snap: narrow-source-40x12
keys: NPage NPage
live-snap: narrow-source-40x12-details
ask: Can the operator distinguish observations across two real SHAs, clean and dirty content at the same SHA, covered absence and unassessed scope without inferring a fix?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/source_transition.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS · 1 | retained-false-positive
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned public documentation example is intentional | retained-human-reason
expect: Reassess this verdict
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: runs diff revision-later revision-absent
require-live-snap: 30 NOT OBSERVED IN COVERED WORK | restarted-covered-absence
expect: Absence does not establish a fix.
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 dirty | restarted-exact-source
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/source_transition.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does restart preserve the historical human decision, four raw observations, all six source-bound run receipts and zero provider work, with neutral CLI and TUI comparisons?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
